    "en": {
      "trackName": "Snappy Word Search",
      "description": "Find words and exercise your brain in this fun word search game.\n\nFind all the hidden words by linking the letters. It's a word game that's addictive and educational!\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n* Swipe the letters to make words.\n* Find all hidden words to complete the level.\n* Earn hint Gems by making words that aren't in the hidden list.\n\nFEATURES\n* 400 challenging levels.\n* Includes a four letter game mode.\n* Play on your Watch and see how you rank.\n* Challenge friends in Message.\n* Develop your vocabulary and train your brain!\n\nEnjoy!\n- Johnno",
      "releaseNotes": "Okay, the game still plays the same BUT I did a massive amount of work updating the game to use the latest SwiftUI code.\nThe UI may look a little different, but this means updates are a lot easier for me to make going forward.\n\nOne thing I did fix is you can now (finally) listen to music while you play :-)\n\nI apologise in advance if I broke anything - if something doesn't work please email me at support@redspritestudios.com\n\nThanks\nJohn",
